---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Sovereign SDK | Zero-Trust C++ Library">
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-slate-950 font-sans text-slate-300 selection:bg-emerald-500/30">
    
    <!-- Navbar -->
    <nav class="h-16 border-b border-white/5 flex items-center justify-between px-6 lg:px-12 sticky top-0 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-md z-50">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 p-1.5 rounded ring-1 ring-emerald-500/20">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="w-5 h-5">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M12 1.5a5.25 5.25 0 0 0-5.25 5.25v3a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v6.75a3 3 0 0 0 3 3h10.5a3 3 0 0 0 3-3v-6.75a3 3 0 0 0-3-3v-3c0-2.9-2.35-5.25-5.25-5.25Zm3.75 8.25v-3a3.75 3.75 0 1 0-7.5 0v3h7.5Z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="text-white font-bold tracking-wide">Sovereign SDK</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <a href="/login" class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center">Login</a>
        <a href="/register" class="text-sm font-medium bg-white text-black hover:bg-slate-200 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full transition-colors flex items-center">Get API Key</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero -->
    <header class="relative pt-32 pb-20 px-6 lg:px-12 overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-center text-center">
      <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-emerald-600/20 rounded-full blur-[150px] pointer-events-none"></div>
      
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 ring-1 ring-emerald-500/20 text-xs font-mono mb-8">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
        v0.0.1-beta.1 (C++17 / Native JSI)
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mb-6 max-w-4xl">
        Seguridad Zero-Trust para <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-400 to-cyan-400">React Native</span>
      </h1>
      
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-400 mb-10 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Librería criptográfica de grado militar compilada nativamente. Firmas DPoP asimétricas y limpieza de memoria estricta (Zeroization) operando por debajo del motor V8/Hermes mediante JSI Bridge.
      </p>

      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <a href="#quickstart" class="bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white font-semibold py-3 px-8 rounded-full transition-all hover:scale-105 shadow-lg shadow-emerald-900/20">
          Ver Documentación
        </a>
        <a href="/register" class="bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white border border-slate-700 font-semibold py-3 px-8 rounded-full transition-all">
          Generar Bundle ID
        </a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Content / Documentation -->
    <section id="quickstart" class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center mb-32">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Integración Nativa Segura</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            A diferencia de otras librerías NPM que mantienen material criptográfico expuesto en la memoria del recolector de basura de JS, <b>Sovereign SDK</b> opera un motor C++ nativo que destruye el material mediante <code class="bg-slate-800 text-emerald-400 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm">SecureZeroMemory</code> inmediatamente después de firmar la transacción.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg> <span>Firmas Ed25519 y RSA-2048</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg> <span>Telemetría de Integridad de Ledger</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg> <span>Comunicación síncrona vía React Native Nitro / JSI</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-2xl relative">
          <div class="absolute -top-3 -right-3 bg-blue-500 text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">cpp/VolatileQueue.hpp</div>
          <pre class="text-sm font-mono text-slate-300 overflow-x-auto"><code><span class="text-slate-500">// Secure hardware wipe (Zeroization)</span>
void VolatileQueue::activeZeroization() &#123;
    std::lock_guard&lt;std::mutex&gt; lock(mutex_);
    
    <span class="text-emerald-400">#ifdef _WIN32</span>
    SecureZeroMemory(arena_, size_);
    <span class="text-emerald-400">#else</span>
    explicit_bzero(arena_, size_);
    <span class="text-emerald-400">#endif</span>
    
    telemetryEngine.recordEvent(
        TelemetryEventType::ZEROIZATION_TRIGGERED, 
        0x00
    );
&#125;</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Core Security Features -->
      <div class="border-t border-slate-800 pt-20 mb-32">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Arquitectura de Seguridad Core</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Basado en 5 pilares fundamentales para proteger la integridad de las transacciones bajo un entorno de memoria volátil y hostil.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-colors">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400 mb-2">Volatile RAM Ledger</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Las peticiones son serializadas a binario y encoladas en un ledger estático C++ en memoria física. Cada bloque se enlaza criptográficamente con SHA-256.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-colors">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400 mb-2">Deterministic Zeroization</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Borrado activo mediante <code>std::fill</code> y <code>SecureZeroMemory</code> inmediatamente después del despacho o expiración del TTL para evitar fugas al Heap JS.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-colors">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400 mb-2">Integrity Watchdog</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Motor en background que detecta manipulación dinámica (inyección o corrupción de memoria). Congela la ejecución y preserva evidencia.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-colors">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400 mb-2">Dynamic DPoP Proofs</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Generación y firma efímera de Pruebas de Posesión (DPoP - RFC 9449) usando WebCrypto para no sobrecargar el core C++.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-colors">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400 mb-2">Transport Agnostic</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Desacoplado de la red vía el patrón Command. Adaptadores nativos para Fetch, Axios o GraphQL incluidos.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-colors">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400 mb-2">Pure JS Mock Mode</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Soporte nativo para <em>fallback engine</em> sin JSI. Ideal para pipelines de CI/CD, web y testing de componentes sin hardware real.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Flow Diagram (Text) -->
      <div class="border-t border-slate-800 pt-20 mb-32">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-8 text-center">Flujo Operativo In-Memory</h2>
        <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-2xl text-slate-300 leading-relaxed max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-4">
          <p>El ciclo de vida en tiempo de ejecución de una petición segura sigue un flujo estricto para garantizar la resiliencia criptográfica:</p>
          <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-4 pl-2 mt-4">
            <li>La aplicación (<code class="text-emerald-400 bg-slate-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm">App</code>) invoca <code class="text-emerald-400 bg-slate-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm">executeRequest()</code> en el <code class="text-emerald-400 bg-slate-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm">SovereignClientCore</code>.</li>
            <li>Se verifica la integridad de la memoria. Si el Ledger ha sido comprometido (ej. inyección de código o memory dump), se lanza inmediatamente un <code class="text-red-400 bg-slate-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm">IntegrityBreachError</code>.</li>
            <li>Si el entorno es seguro, se comprueba la conexión a red:
              <ul class="list-disc list-outside pl-8 mt-3 space-y-2 text-slate-400 text-sm">
                <li><strong class="text-white">Online:</strong> Se adjunta la prueba DPoP efímera y se despacha la petición al <code class="text-emerald-400 bg-slate-800 px-1 rounded">NetworkAdapter</code>. Al recibir éxito, se ejecuta el borrado seguro en hardware (<code class="text-emerald-400 bg-slate-800 px-1 rounded">SecureZeroMemory</code>) sobre los buffers para no dejar rastros en memoria, y se retorna la respuesta.</li>
                <li><strong class="text-white">Offline o HTTP 503:</strong> La petición se encola en el ledger volátil (<code class="text-emerald-400 bg-slate-800 px-1 rounded">MemoryQueue</code>). El núcleo C++ enlaza criptográficamente el payload mediante un encadenamiento SHA-256 (hash $H_n$) e inicia un zeroize de variables temporales, retornando una Promesa pendiente a la aplicación que se resolverá automáticamente en la reconexión.</li>
              </ul>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Usage Examples -->
      <div class="border-t border-slate-800 pt-20 mb-20">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-12 text-center">Ejemplos de Uso Conceptuales</h2>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <!-- Example 1 -->
          <div class="bg-[#0d1117] border border-slate-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl flex flex-col">
            <div class="px-4 py-3 border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 flex justify-between items-center">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">1. Setup Básico (Queue & Replay)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6 overflow-x-auto flex-1">
              <pre class="text-sm font-mono text-slate-300 leading-relaxed"><code><span class="text-purple-400">import</span> &#123; SovereignClientCore, FetchAdapter &#125; <span class="text-purple-400">from</span> <span class="text-emerald-300">'@sovereign/secure-client'</span>;

<span class="text-blue-400">const</span> client = SovereignClientCore.getInstance(&#123;
  <span class="text-slate-400">cryptoProvider</span>: myCryptoProvider,
  <span class="text-slate-400">networkResolver</span>: <span class="text-blue-400">async</span> () =&gt; navigator.onLine,
  <span class="text-slate-400">networkAdapter</span>: <span class="text-blue-400">new</span> FetchAdapter(),
  <span class="text-slate-400">defaultTTL</span>: <span class="text-orange-400">60000</span>
&#125;);

<span class="text-slate-500">// Trapped in C++ memory if disconnected</span>
<span class="text-blue-400">const</span> res = client.executeRequest(<span class="text-emerald-300">'tx_101'</span>, &#123;
  method: <span class="text-emerald-300">'POST'</span>, url: <span class="text-emerald-300">'/v1/ledger'</span>, body: myPayload
&#125;);

<span class="text-slate-500">// Synchronous replay after reconnection</span>
<span class="text-purple-400">await</span> client.processSynchronizedQueue(<span class="text-blue-400">async</span> () =&gt; <span class="text-blue-400">true</span>);</code></pre>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Example 2 -->
          <div class="bg-[#0d1117] border border-slate-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl flex flex-col">
            <div class="px-4 py-3 border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 flex justify-between items-center">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">2. Integración con Axios</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6 overflow-x-auto flex-1">
              <pre class="text-sm font-mono text-slate-300 leading-relaxed"><code><span class="text-purple-400">import</span> &#123; SovereignClientCore, AxiosAdapter &#125; <span class="text-purple-400">from</span> <span class="text-emerald-300">'@sovereign/secure-client'</span>;
<span class="text-purple-400">import</span> axios <span class="text-purple-400">from</span> <span class="text-emerald-300">'axios'</span>;

<span class="text-blue-400">const</span> client = SovereignClientCore.getInstance(&#123;
  <span class="text-slate-400">cryptoProvider</span>: myCryptoProvider,
  <span class="text-slate-400">networkAdapter</span>: <span class="text-blue-400">new</span> AxiosAdapter(&#123; axiosInstance: axios.create() &#125;),
  <span class="text-slate-400">errorTrapping</span>: &#123; freezeOn503_504: <span class="text-blue-400">true</span> &#125;
&#125;);

client.executeRequest(<span class="text-emerald-300">'tx_102'</span>, &#123; 
  method: <span class="text-emerald-300">'POST'</span>, 
  url: <span class="text-emerald-300">'/api/ledger/degraded'</span>, 
  body: myPayload 
&#125;);</code></pre>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Example 3 -->
          <div class="bg-[#0d1117] border border-slate-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl flex flex-col">
            <div class="px-4 py-3 border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 flex justify-between items-center">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">3. Integración con Fetch</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6 overflow-x-auto flex-1">
              <pre class="text-sm font-mono text-slate-300 leading-relaxed"><code><span class="text-purple-400">import</span> &#123; SovereignClientCore, FetchAdapter &#125; <span class="text-purple-400">from</span> <span class="text-emerald-300">'@sovereign/secure-client'</span>;

<span class="text-blue-400">const</span> client = SovereignClientCore.getInstance(&#123;
  <span class="text-slate-400">cryptoProvider</span>: myCryptoProvider,
  <span class="text-slate-400">networkResolver</span>: <span class="text-blue-400">async</span> () =&gt; navigator.onLine,
  <span class="text-slate-400">networkAdapter</span>: <span class="text-blue-400">new</span> FetchAdapter()
&#125;);

client.executeRequest(<span class="text-emerald-300">'tx_103'</span>, &#123; 
  method: <span class="text-emerald-300">'GET'</span>, 
  url: <span class="text-emerald-300">'https://api.vesper.local/v1/data'</span> 
&#125;);</code></pre>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Example 4 -->
          <div class="bg-[#0d1117] border border-slate-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl flex flex-col">
            <div class="px-4 py-3 border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 flex justify-between items-center">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">4. Integración con GraphQL</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6 overflow-x-auto flex-1">
              <pre class="text-sm font-mono text-slate-300 leading-relaxed"><code><span class="text-purple-400">import</span> &#123; SovereignClientCore, GraphQLAdapter &#125; <span class="text-purple-400">from</span> <span class="text-emerald-300">'@sovereign/secure-client'</span>;

<span class="text-blue-400">const</span> client = SovereignClientCore.getInstance(&#123;
  <span class="text-slate-400">networkAdapter</span>: <span class="text-blue-400">new</span> GraphQLAdapter(&#123; 
    endpoint: <span class="text-emerald-300">'https://api.vesper.local/graphql'</span> 
  &#125;)
&#125;);

client.executeRequest(<span class="text-emerald-300">'tx_104'</span>, &#123;
  method: <span class="text-emerald-300">'POST'</span>,
  url: <span class="text-emerald-300">''</span>,
  body: new TextEncoder().encode(JSON.stringify(&#123; 
    query: <span class="text-emerald-300">'mutation &#123; createTx(amount: 1500) &#125;'</span> 
  &#125;))
&#125;);</code></pre>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-slate-800 pt-20">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-8 text-center">Quick Start (TypeScript)</h2>
        <div class="bg-[#0d1117] border border-slate-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          <div class="flex items-center px-4 py-3 border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-900">
            <div class="flex gap-2">
              <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-500"></div>
              <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></div>
              <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-4 text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">app/index.ts</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 overflow-x-auto">
            <pre class="text-sm font-mono text-slate-300 leading-relaxed"><code><span class="text-purple-400">import</span> &#123; SovereignClientCore &#125; <span class="text-purple-400">from</span> <span class="text-emerald-300">'@sovereign/secure-client'</span>;

<span class="text-slate-500">// 1. Initialize Core connecting to Nitro JSI Bridge</span>
<span class="text-blue-400">const</span> client = <span class="text-blue-400">new</span> SovereignClientCore(&#123;
  <span class="text-slate-400">apiKey</span>: <span class="text-emerald-300">'sk_test_tu_api_key_aqui'</span>,
  <span class="text-slate-400">endpoint</span>: <span class="text-emerald-300">'https://api.yourcompany.com'</span>,
  <span class="text-slate-400">dpopOptions</span>: &#123; algorithm: <span class="text-emerald-300">'ES256'</span> &#125;
&#125;);

<span class="text-slate-500">// 2. Requests are natively signed without exposing the key in JS</span>
<span class="text-blue-400">const</span> response = <span class="text-purple-400">await</span> client.execute(&#123;
  method: <span class="text-emerald-300">'POST'</span>,
  path: <span class="text-emerald-300">'/v1/secure/transactions'</span>,
  body: &#123; amount: <span class="text-orange-400">1500</span>, currency: <span class="text-emerald-300">'USD'</span> &#125;
&#125;);

<span class="text-slate-500">// 3. If memory dump or tampering is detected, telemetry is triggered</span>
<span class="text-slate-500">// and the web console will receive the FATAL alert automatically.</span></code></pre>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="border-t border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 py-12 mt-20 text-center">
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">© 2026 Sovereign Developer Platform. B2B Dashboard.</p>
    </footer>

  </main>
</Layout>
